        >
          <span
            class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-600 dark:bg-indigo-400 animate-pulse"
          ></span>
          <span
            >Zero Registration &bull; 100% Client-Side Privacy &bull; Edge SSE
            Streaming</span
