        </div>

        <!-- Main Headline -->
        <h1
          class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight max-w-4xl mx-auto leading-tight font-sans hero-title-text"
        >
          The Webhook Debugger <br class="hidden sm:inline" />
          <span class="hero-gradient-text"> Engineered for Developers </span>
        </h1>

        <!-- Subtitle -->
        <p
          class="text-base sm:text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto font-normal leading-relaxed text-slate-400 light:text-slate-600"
          style="color: var(--text-secondary);"
        >
          Inspect incoming HTTP requests, verify cryptographic HMAC signatures,
          simulate latency and status codes, and replay payloads to localhost
          without servers or signups.
        </p>

        <!-- CTA Action Buttons -->
        <div
          class="pt-2 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-3 sm:gap-4"
        >
